## 🔒 Certyfikaty SSL (Tailscale)

```bash
# Generowanie certyfikatu Tailscale
tailscale cert --cert-file /opt/certs/labo.tail24d7d0.ts.net.crt \
               --key-file /opt/certs/labo.tail24d7d0.ts.net.key \
               labo.tail24d7d0.ts.net

# Sprawdzenie certyfikatu
openssl x509 -in /opt/certs/labo.tail24d7d0.ts.net.crt -noout -dates
```

